<description>&lt;p&gt;Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass. An Ecuadorian thief pleaded guilty to participation in the largest U.S. jewelry heist, and a major Ecuadorian cocaine and weapons trafficking ring was busted in New York. These incidents show that high-profile transnational crimes and attacks on media figures are now part of the crisis, expanding beyond the prison-gang violence that previously dominated. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPejczSE1abGk4YTRzWE1ZX2ROSHp5WVRBYUtSemItUWlIdHRoZkZjYWtKUFRhTjhDNzhzYjdzb0FCcXJLd0xtM3pGbHA5SGY5RS1ZSnN3QWUwU1FXNnVJc0gwTVFBWlF2RWMtV2duNWcxM3gySUg0WEN0UEdKU2s3SGhhdmw3OXc0NDV5NGN2RTQ1dEk?oc=5&quot;&gt;Newsday&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPWXM2aEZSWTVQMWhaOG00RDlGNkdERVRKd05fT2w0c0tfdVhIbnk4bnZPalk5Z2JNNm5hRVhLVGtZNlhUTE4xS0dDOTdmZnc2Rko0WUFHdWhad3ZLYVI5eUtRb2RMSVZ5SGh4YTdtcEtYVm5HOGRpbFhycVQxdUJZY0lIeV9xdndtaU94NVB5VGREXzk3MnNKdXN5bDYydzM2MWhYUERDbWRIbS1zVmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Independent&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxQZTRBZHc3ZlRnQmdEeXlVU1NyM2NGVjh6XzMtZURJVXBhQTNQNldrdTNIUWx5aEVreXFKc0Uzamp0TFZwRGNWbVh4SU1aeHJ6RzczaEVaeTRoSFBmNGZMYUVIV1MwQldFMzdoV2FzU2hYWDhEV3p2bXZxMkFvVHBjN3lQaGlWbEdmTUxQNlo3QkxpeWl6dklJSGpXMld1NEU4T3Vs